{"D:\\wt\\ssimple4\\vlog\\ssimple4\\voz\\b000_t3.wav": {"text": "This is my mother at 62, in her first calligraphy class in Osaka, holding a brush for the first time since she was a little girl. Everybody in that room was younger than her. She lived to a hundred and one. After 60, most people start stopping things. My mother did the opposite. She started nine new things, one by one, and she kept every single one of them for almost forty years. Today I will tell you all nine, and number nine is the reason she was never lonely, not even at a hundred, when every friend her own age was already gone. One of them she did every school morning at a street corner in a green armband for twenty-two years. Another one cost her one coin a day, and at New Year it made eleven grandchildren run to her door. But first, one honest thing. I cannot promise you a hundred and one. Nobody can. This is not advice from a clinic.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.5}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.66}, {"w": " mother", "s": 0.66, "e": 0.98}, {"w": " at", "s": 0.98, "e": 1.26}, {"w": " 62,", "s": 1.26, "e": 2.46}, {"w": " in", "s": 2.46, "e": 2.56}, {"w": " her", "s": 2.56, "e": 2.7}, {"w": " first", "s": 2.7, "e": 3.12}, {"w": " calligraphy", "s": 3.12, "e": 3.72}, {"w": " class", "s": 3.72, "e": 4.08}, {"w": " in", "s": 4.08, "e": 4.24}, {"w": " Osaka,", "s": 4.24, "e": 5.3}, {"w": " holding", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.52}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.52, "e": 5.7}, {"w": " brush", "s": 5.7, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " for", "s": 6.02, "e": 6.2}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.2, "e": 6.32}, {"w": " first", "s": 6.32, "e": 6.68}, {"w": " time", "s": 6.22, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " since", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.36}, {"w": " she", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.52}, {"w": " was", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.7}, {"w": " a", "s": 7.7, "e": 7.82}, {"w": " little", "s": 7.82, "e": 8.02}, {"w": " girl.", "s": 8.02, "e": 8.98}, {"w": " Everybody", "s": 8.78, "e": 9.5}, {"w": " in", "s": 9.5, "e": 9.76}, {"w": " that", "s"