e said, the telephone is for news, but a letter is for feelings, and you cannot hold a telephone call in your hand when you miss somebody. Most people today send a quick message on the phone and forget it in one minute. A letter, she said, somebody keeps. I still have 140 of her letters. Everyone starts the same way, with the weather in Osaka. Write one letter this Sunday.", "words": [{"w": " Every", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.28}, {"w": " Sunday", "s": 0.28, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " afternoon,", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.66}, {"w": " after", "s": 1.66, "e": 1.96}, {"w": " lunch,", "s": 1.96, "e": 2.86}, {"w": " she", "s": 2.86, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " sat", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.24}, {"w": " at", "s": 3.24, "e": 3.44}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.44, "e": 3.64}, {"w": " low", "s": 3.64, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " table", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.2}, {"w": " with", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.76}, {"w": " her", "s": 4.76, "e": 4.94}, {"w": " good", "s": 4.94, "e": 5.24}, {"w": " pen", "s": 5.24, "e": 5.62}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.62, "e": 6.08}, {"w": " wrote", "s": 6.08, "e": 6.34}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.34, "e": 6.68}, {"w": " letter", "s": 6.68, "e": 7.02}, {"w": " by", "s": 7.02, "e": 7.26}, {"w": " hand.", "s": 7.26, "e": 7.9}, {"w": " To", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.28}, {"w": " me,", "s": 8.28, "e": 8.9}, {"w": " far", "s": 8.9, "e": 9.26}, {"w": " away,", "s": 9.26, "e": 9.8}, {"w": " to", "s": 9.8, "e": 10.14}, {"w": " my", "s": 10.14, "e": 10.3}, {"w": " brothers,", "s": 10.3, "e": 11.26}, {"w": " to", "s": 11.26, "e": 11.36}, {"w": " a", "s": 11.36, "e": 11.54}, {"w": " cousin", "s": 11.54, "e": 11.86}, {"w": " in", "s": 11.86, "e": 12.04}, {"w": " the", "s": 12.04, "e": 12.18}, {"w": " countryside,", "s": 12.18, "e": 13.3}, {"w": " to", "s": 13.3, "e": 13.4}, {"w": " her", "s": 13.4, "e": 13.58}, {"w": " old", "s": 13.58, "e": 13.88}, {"w": " teacher,", "s": 13.88, "e": 14.78}, {"w": " to", "s": 14.78, "e": 14.86}, {"w": " a", "s": 14.86, "e": 15.08}, {"w": " neighbor", "s": 15.08, "e": 15.38}, {"w": " who", "s": 15.38, "e": 15.6